臣雖頑凶，無覬古人，其于被堅執銳，致身寇仇，所謂天地之施，群生莫謝不勝。受恩至深，謹拜表陳聞。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":30,"last_line":30,"raw_start":2245,"raw_end":2655,"raw_character_offsets":[2255,2256,2257,2258,2259,2260,2261,2262,2263,2264,2265,2266,2267,2268,2269,2270,2271,2272,2273,2274,2275,2276,2277,2278,2279,2280,2281,2282,2283,2284,2285,2286,2287,2288,2289,2290,2291,2292,2293,2294,2295,2296,2297,2298,2299,2300,2301,2302,2303,2304,2305,2306,2307,2308,2309,2310,2311,2312,2313,2314,2315,2316,2317,2318,2319,2320,2321,2322,2323,2324,2325,2326,2327,2328,2329,2330,2331,2332,2333,2334,2335,2336,2337,2338,2339,2340,2341,2342,2343,2344,2345,2346,2347,2348,2349,2350,2351,2352,2353,2354,2355,2356,2357,2358,2359,2360,2361,2362,2363,2364,2365,2366,2367,2368,2369,2370,2371,2372,2373,2374,2375,2376,2377,2378,2379,2380,2381,2382,2383,2384,2385,2386,2387,2388,2389,2390,2391,2392,2393,2394,2395,2396,2397,2398,2399,2400,2401,2402,2403,2404,2405,2406,2407,2408,2409,2410,2411,2412,2413,2414,2415,2416,2417,2418,2419,2420,2421,2422,2423,2424,2425,2426,2427,2428,2429,2430,2431,2432,2433,2434,2435,2436,2437,2438,2439,2440,2441,2442,2443,2444,2445,2446,2447,2448,2449,2450,2451,2452,2453,2454,2455,2456,2457,2458,2459,2460,2461,2462,2463,2464,2465,2466,2467,2468,2469,2470,2471,2472,2473,2474,2475,2476,2477,2478,2479,2480,2481,2482,2483,2484,2485,2486,2487,2488,2489,2490,2491,2492,2493,2494,2495,2496,2497,2498,2499,2500,2501,2502,2503,2504,2505,2506,2507,2508,2509,2510,2511,2512,2513,2514,2515,2516,2517,2518,2519,2520,2521,2522,2523,2524,2525,2526,2527,2528,2529,2530,2531,2532,2533,2534,2535,2536,2537,2538,2539,2540,2541,2542,2543,2544,2545,2546,2547,2548,2549,2550,2551,2552,2553,2554,2555,2556,2557,2558,2559,2560,2561,2562,2563,2564,2565,2566,2567,2568,2569,2570,2571,2572,2573,2574,2575,2576,2577,2578,2579,2580,2581,2582,2583,2584,2585,2586,2587,2588,2589,2590,2591,2592,2593,2594,2595,2596,2597,2598,2599,2600,2601,2602,2603,2604,2605,2606,2607,2608,2609,2610,2611,2612,2613,2614,2615,2616,2617,2618,2619,2620,2621,2622,2623,2624,2625,2626,2627,2628,2629,2630,2631,2632,2633,2634,2635,2636,2637,2638,2639,2640,2641,2642,2643,2644,2645,2646,2647,2648,2649,2650,2651,2652],"revision_id":2629226},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-062-liukun:p010:m0323","surface":"申胥","start":323,"end":325,"person_id":"0rc_0ya_wg8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-062-liukun:p010:m0337","surface":"伍員","start":337,"end":339,"person_id":"g9h_5ih_ug1_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-062-liukun","book_id":"b-jinshu-062","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-062-liukun-ws2629226"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line036","text":"昔包胥楚國之微臣，重趼致誠，義感諸侯。藺相如趙邦之陪隸，恥君之辱，按劍秦庭。皇漢之季，董卓作亂，劫遷獻帝，虐害忠良，關東州郡相率同盟。廣陵功曹臧洪，郡之小吏耳，登壇喢血，涕淚橫流，慷慨之節，實厲群后。况今居台鼎，據方州，列名邦，受國恩者哉！不期而會，不謀而同，不亦宜乎！","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line036:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"包胥","kind":"person","person_id":"0rc_0ya_wg8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line036:m0019","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"藺相如","kind":"person","person_id":"sfa_wwl_tt2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line036:m0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"董卓","kind":"person","person_id":"a50_1e6_4bf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line036:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"獻帝","kind":"person","person_id":"e49_8a5_738","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line036:m0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"臧洪","kind":"person","person_id":"fru_3sq_vzd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":36,"last_line":36,"revision_id":2592755},"source_quote":{"witness":"j67","quote":"昔包胥楚國之微臣，重趼致誠，義感諸侯。藺相如趙邦之陪隸，恥君之辱，按劍秦庭。皇漢之季，董卓作亂，劫遷獻帝，虐害忠良，關東州郡相率同盟。廣陵功曹臧洪，郡之小吏耳，登壇喢血，涕淚橫流，慷慨之節，實厲群后。况今居台鼎，據方州，列名邦，受國恩者哉！不期而會，不謀而同，不亦宜乎！","raw_start":3689,"raw_end":3824,"raw_line":36},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao","book_id":"b-jinshu-067","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-067-wenqiao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line076","text":"既而錢鳳攻逼京都，假鑒節，加衛將軍、都督從駕諸軍事。鑒以無益事實，固辭不受軍號。時議者以王含、錢鳳眾力百倍，苑城小而不固，宜及軍勢未成，大駕自出距戰。鑒曰：「群逆縱逸，其勢不可當，可以算屈，難以力競。且含等號令不一，抄盜相尋，百姓懲往年之暴，皆人自為守。乘逆順之勢，何往不剋！且賊無經略遠圖，惟恃豕突一戰，曠日持久，必啟義士之心，令謀猷得展。今以此弱力敵彼彊寇，決勝負於一朝，定成敗於呼吸，雖有申胥之徒，義存投袂，何補於既往哉！」帝從之。鑒以尚書令領諸屯營。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line076:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"錢鳳","kind":"person","person_id":"762_5c8_663","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line076:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line076:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line076:m0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"王含","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line076:m0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"錢鳳","kind":"person","person_id":"762_5c8_663","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line076:m0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line076:m0101","start":101,"end":102,"surface":"含","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line076:m0197","start":197,"end":199,"surface":"申胥","kind":"person","person_id":"0rc_0ya_wg8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line076:m0219","start":219,"end":220,"surface":"鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":76,"last_line":76,"revision_id":2592755},"source_quote":{"witness":"j67","quote":"既而錢鳳攻逼京都，假鑒節，加衛將軍、都督從駕諸軍事。鑒以無益事實，固辭不受軍號。時議者以王含、錢鳳眾力百倍，苑城小而不固，宜及軍勢未成，大駕自出距戰。鑒曰：「群逆縱逸，其勢不可當，可以算屈，難以力競。且含等號令不一，抄盜相尋，百姓懲往年之暴，皆人自為守。乘逆順之勢，何往不剋！且賊無經略遠圖，惟恃豕突一戰，曠日持久，必啟義士之心，令謀猷得展。今以此弱力敵彼彊寇，決勝負於一朝，定成敗於呼吸，雖有申胥之徒，義存投袂，何補於既往哉！」帝從之。鑒以尚書令領諸屯營。","raw_start":7367,"raw_end":7596,"raw_line":76},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian","book_id":"b-jinshu-067","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-067-xijian"},{"id":"c-jinshu-071-sunhui:p004","text":"秘之不天，值此衰運，竊慕墨翟、申包之誠，跋涉荊棘，重繭而至，櫛風沐雨，來承禍難。思以管穴毗佐大猷，道險時吝，未敢自顯。伏在川泥，系情宸極，謹先白箋，以啟天慮。若猶沈吟際會，徘徊二端，徼幸在險，請從恕宥之例。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":16,"last_line":16,"raw_start":1006,"raw_end":1109,"raw_character_offsets":[1006,1007,1008,1009,1010,1011,1012,1013,1014,1015,1016,1017,1018,1019,1020,1021,1022,1023,1024,1025,1026,1027,1028,1029,1030,1031,1032,1033,1034,1035,1036,1037,1038,1039,1040,1041,1042,1043,1044,1045,1046,1047,1048,1049,1050,1051,1052,1053,1054,1055,1056,1057,1058,1059,1060,1061,1062,1063,1064,1065,1066,1067,1068,1069,1070,1071,1072,1073,1074,1075,1076,1077,1078,1079,1080,1081,1082,1083,1084,1085,1086,1087,1088,1089,1090,1091,1092,1093,1094,1095,1096,1097,1098,1099,1100,1101,1102,1103,1104,1105,1106,1107,1108],"revision_id":2595541},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-071-sunhui:p004:m0012","surface":"墨翟","start":12,"end":14,"person_id":"tjx_q6x_kc7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-071-sunhui:p004:m0015","surface":"申包","start":15,"end":17,"person_id":"0rc_0ya_wg8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-071-sunhui","book_id":"b-jinshu-071","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-071-sunhui-ws2595541"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004","text":"禎明二年，詔授鎭南大將軍、都督二十四州諸軍事，尋命徙鎭廣州。未之鎭，而隋師濟江，猛總督所部赴援。時廣州刺史臨汝侯方慶、西衡州刺史衡陽王伯信並隸猛督府，各觀望不至。猛使高州刺史戴智烈、清遠太守曾孝遠各以輕兵就斬之而發其兵。及聞台城不守，乃舉哀素服，藉稿不食，歎曰：「申包胥獨何人哉。」因勒兵緣江拒守，以固誠節。及審後主不死，乃遣其部將辛昉馳驛赴京師歸款。隋文帝大悅，謂昉曰：「猛懷其舊主，送故情深，即是我之誠臣。保守一方，不勞兵甲，又是我之功臣。」即日拜昉開府儀同三司，仍詔猛與行軍總管韋洸便留嶺表經略。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0040","surface":"猛","start":40,"end":41,"person_id":"72e_1a7_3ac_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0056","surface":"方慶","start":56,"end":58,"person_id":"eaj_zin_zxy_AB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0067","surface":"伯信","start":67,"end":69,"person_id":"5ye_fwj_neh_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0071","surface":"猛","start":71,"end":72,"person_id":"72e_1a7_3ac_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0081","surface":"猛","start":81,"end":82,"person_id":"72e_1a7_3ac_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0087","surface":"戴智烈","start":87,"end":90,"person_id":"094_ia6_xvv","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0095","surface":"曾孝遠","start":95,"end":98,"person_id":"px5_c29_v6z","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0132","surface":"申包胥","start":132,"end":135,"person_id":"0rc_0ya_wg8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0166","su